     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Observation SpecularMicroscopyRightEyeExample</b></p><a name=\"SpecularMicroscopyRightEyeExample\"> </a><a name=\"hcSpecularMicroscopyRightEyeExample\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-specular-microscopy.html\">Ophthalmic Specular Microscopy</a></p></div><p><b>status</b>: Final</p><p><b>category</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/observation-category exam}\">Exam</span></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Corneal endothelial specular microscopy</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Patient-PatientExample.html\">Patient Example  Female, DoB: 1990-01-01 ( PA1234567)</a></p><p><b>note</b>: </p><blockquote><div><p>Example based on typical Topcon SP-1P specular microscopy report</p>\n</div></blockquote><p><b>bodySite</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\"></span></p><p><b>method</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Automated</span></p><p><b>device</b>: Topcon SP-1P</p><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Capture position</span></p><p><b>value</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Central</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Endothelial cell density (CD)</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 2456 /mm2<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  code/mm2 = '/mm2')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Number of cells analyzed (N)</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 98 1<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  code1 = '1')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Coefficient of